har_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","location":"61:5:23","transliteration":{"text":"l-fāsiqīna"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"٥","location":"61:5:24","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Musa milletine: \"Ey milletim! Beni niçin incitirsiniz? Oysa, benim size gönderilmiş Allah'ın bir peygamberi olduğumu biliyorsunuz\" demişti. Ama onlar yoldan sapınca, Allah da onların kalblerini saptırmıştı. Allah, yoldan çıkan milleti doğru yola eriştirmez.","transliteration":"wa-idh qāla mūsā liqawmihi yāqawmi lima tu'dhūnanī waqad taʿlamūna annī rasūlu l-lahi ilaykum falammā zāghū azāgha l-lahu qulūbahum wal-lahu lā yahdī l-qawma l-fāsiqīna"},{"id":5169,"verse_key":"61:6","verse_number":6,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَإِذْ","location":"61:6:1","transliteration":{"text":"wa-idh"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"قَالَ","location":"61:6:2","transliteration":{"text":"qāla"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عِيسَى","location":"61:6:3","transliteration":{"text":"ʿīsā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱبْنُ","location":"61:6:4","transliteration":{"text":"ub'nu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مَرْيَمَ","location":"61:6:5","transliteration":{"text":"maryama"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ","location":"61:6:6","transliteration":{"text":"yābanī"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","location":"61:6:7","transliteration":{"text":"is'rāīla"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","location":"61:6:8","transliteration":{"text":"innī"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"رَسُولُ","location":"61:6:9","transliteration":{"text":"rasūlu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","location":"61:6:10","transliteration":{"text":"l-lahi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكُم","location":"61:6:11","transliteration":{"text":"ilaykum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مُّصَدِّقًۭا","location":"61:6:12","transl