siḥ'run"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٌۭ","location":"61:6:31","transliteration":{"text":"mubīnun"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"٦","location":"61:6:32","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Meryem oğlu İsa: \"Ey İsrailoğulları! Doğrusu ben, benden önce gelmiş olan Tevrat'ı doğrulayan, benden sonra gelecek ve adı Ahmet olacak bir peygamberi müjdeleyen, Allah'ın size gönderilmiş bir peygamberiyim\" demişti. Ama o elçi, kendilerine belgelerle geldiği zaman: \"Bu, apaçık bir sihirdir\" demişlerdi.","transliteration":"wa-idh qāla ʿīsā ub'nu maryama yābanī is'rāīla innī rasūlu l-lahi ilaykum muṣaddiqan limā bayna yadayya mina l-tawrāti wamubashiran birasūlin yatī min baʿdī us'muhu aḥmadu falammā jāahum bil-bayināti qālū hādhā siḥ'run mubīnun"},{"id":5170,"verse_key":"61:7","verse_number":7,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","location":"61:7:1","transliteration":{"text":"waman"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَظْلَمُ","location":"61:7:2","transliteration":{"text":"aẓlamu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مِمَّنِ","location":"61:7:3","transliteration":{"text":"mimmani"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","location":"61:7:4","transliteration":{"text":"if'tarā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عَلَى","location":"61:7:5","transliteration":{"text":"ʿalā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","location":"61:7:6","transliteration":{"text":"l-lahi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَذِبَ","location":"61:7:7","transliteration":{"text":"l-kadhiba"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","location":"61:7:8","transliteration":{"text":"wahuwa"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يُدْعَىٰٓ","location":"61:7:9","transliteration":{"text":"yud'ʿā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِلَى","location":"61:7:10","transliteration":{"text":"ilā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِسْلَـٰمِ ۚ","location":"61:7:11","